# Integrations plane (P5-D — optional)

SSRF-safe egress + Zibal (IR) + Stripe Connect **Accounts v2** + webhook ingress. **Deferred until second customer needs gateway.**

**Nano spec:** [`TEMP/p5/p5-d-integrations-plane.md`](../../TEMP/p5/p5-d-integrations-plane.md)

---

