## Egress URL guard (frozen — P5-D-N-002 EG-01..05)

Implementation: `apps/api/src/integrations/egress/assert-safe-outbound-url.ts`

| Assert | Input | Behavior |
|--------|-------|----------|
| EG-01 | `http://127.0.0.1/...` | throws `EgressUrlBlockedError` (`EGRESS_URL_BLOCKED`) |
| EG-02 | `http://169.254.169.254/...` or `metadata.google.internal` | throws `EgressUrlBlockedError` |
| EG-03 | `ftp://`, `file://`, non-http(s) scheme | throws `EgressUrlBlockedError` |
| EG-04 | optional `allowedHosts` + host ∉ set | throws `EgressHostNotAllowlistedError` |
| EG-05 | RFC1918 + link-local IPv4/IPv6 literals | throws `EgressUrlBlockedError` |

Callers pass tenant-influenced URLs through `assertSafeOutboundUrl` **before** `TenantHttpProxy.fetch` (N-003).

Spec: `apps/api/test/egress-url.spec.ts`.

