Implementation: `apps/api/src/proxy/tenant-http-proxy.ts`

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| EG-06 | `TenantHttpProxy.fetch` calls `assertSafeOutboundUrl` before global `fetch` when `egressGuard !== false` |
