## Zibal payment adapter (frozen — P5-D-N-004 PSP-01)

Implementation: `apps/api/src/integrations/payments/zibal/`

| Assert | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| PSP-01 | `createZibalPaymentRequest` validates tenant `callbackUrl` with `assertSafeOutboundUrl` **before** outbound fetch |
| PSP-01b | POST JSON to `https://gateway.zibal.ir/v1/request` with `merchant` from `ZIBAL_MERCHANT` env only |
| PSP-01c | `result === 100` + `trackId` → returns redirect URL `https://gateway.zibal.ir/start/{trackId}` |
| PSP-01d | Missing `ZIBAL_MERCHANT` → `ZibalMerchantNotConfiguredError` (503) |

**Env:** `ZIBAL_MERCHANT` — platform secret; never stored in workspace metadata JSON.

Spec: `apps/api/test/zibal-adapter.spec.ts`.

