### Inbound webhook sequence (frozen — P5-D-N-006..N-007)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant PSP as Zibal/Stripe
  participant API as payments webhook route
  participant Cache as replay cache
  participant Handler as idempotent finance handler

  PSP->>API: POST body + signature + timestamp
  API->>API: verify HMAC + skew ±5m
  alt bad signature or skew
    API-->>PSP: 401/400 (no handler)
  else ok
    API->>Cache: seen(eventId)?
    alt replay
      API-->>PSP: 409 or 200 noop
    else fresh
      Cache->>Handler: process once
      Handler-->>PSP: 200
    end
  end
```

### Residual risks (accepted until P5-D exit)

| Risk | Mitigation in EPIC |
|------|-------------------|
| Allowlist too broad | Start with Zibal + Stripe host literals only; expand via doc change |
| Webhook IP spoofing at edge | Optional `PAYMENTS_WEBHOOK_ALLOWED_IPS` from legacy env schema |
| Stripe API version drift | Pin Accounts **v2** in adapter; no v1 Account creation |

